    "description": "The Pharmacy Prescription History API allows users to access the historical data of prescriptions processed through the pharmacy system. This endpoint is essential for healthcare professionals and pharmacies to track patient prescription records, ensuring continuity of care and compliance with treatment protocols. It is typically utilized by pharmacists, healthcare providers, and health information systems seeking to retrieve comprehensive prescription history for individual patients. By leveraging this API, users can efficiently manage and update patient medication records, enhancing overall service delivery.",
